    rectangle "==Effects\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nParticles, floating text and flyers (resources homing into the pack), with budgets and a flyer lifetime so bursts stay cheap." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.Effects
    rectangle "==HUD and Sheet\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nResource chips and rates, the depth marker, the contextual thumb buttons, and the bottom sheet: the Progression map (family rails over the upgrade registry), Build, and Beyond. Shows names, levels, numbers and prices only; no instructions (those live in the wiki)." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.HUDandSheet
    rectangle "==Audio\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nA small WebAudio synth unlocked by the first gesture: per-material gather voices, collect/build/upgrade/fanfare cues and an extractor hum. Takes parameters, never reads game state." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.Audio
    rectangle "==Storage\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript + localStorage]</size>\n\nGuarded localStorage: load, save (reporting failures) and clear, plus per-browser view settings." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.Storage
    rectangle "==Main Loop\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nWires the modules together and owns the current state (game.state, replaced on embark/reset). Each frame: steer the player, Core step(), turn logistics events into flyers, reveal fog on tile change, repeat the held action, update effects, run the save/milestone/HUD timers, then render. Exposes window.MTE_GAME for the browser tests." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.MainLoop
    rectangle "==Input\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nRaw touch/mouse/keyboard to intents: drag-anywhere joystick, tap, hold Gather (button or Space), the Trail stroke (hold Gather and draw), pinch/wheel/button zoom, and sheet shortcuts. Holds no game state; calls the handlers it is given." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.Input
    rectangle "==Controller\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nApplies intents to the game: tap (descend, harvest, collect, or walk there), the held action (collect, else harvest), Trail sweeps, going down and up between layers, buying, building, embarking, resetting. Each calls the Core, then triggers effects, sound, HUD and a save." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.Controller
    rectangle "==Camera\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nMaps world (x, y, height) to screen pixels and back (project/unproject) with zoom and a tilt from top-down to 2.5D; picking hits the top or face you see. Also the visible tile range." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.Camera
